          "chunk_id": "s02_c01",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s02_c1_imagine_robot_controller_imitation_y",
          "text": "Imagine training a robot controller by imitation. You watch the training loss, and it drops smoothly and stays low. Everything looks fine.",
