          "chunk_index": 3,
          "chunk_id": "s02_c03",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s02_c3_about_gap_single_step_imitation_loss",
          "text": "This paper is about that gap. The single-step imitation loss is calm and stable, yet the thing you truly care about, the long-horizon reward, is oscillating wildly.",
          "expected_role": "figure",
          "cue_keywords": [
            "about",
            "gap",
