          "chunk_id": "s03_c04",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s03_c4_authors_argue_dangerous_illusion_rea",
          "text": "The authors argue this is a dangerous illusion, and that the real culprit behind the instability is not the data or the model, but the noise in the optimizer itself.",
