          "chunk_index": 4,
          "chunk_id": "s04_c04",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s04_c4_third_demonstrates_exact_same_phenom",
          "text": "Third, it demonstrates the exact same phenomenon and the same cure in autoregressive language models, and complements everything with a convex theory vignette. The upshot is a call to treat iterate averaging as an essential design choice, a stabilizer that belongs alongside your optimizer and your scheduler.",
          "expected_role": "method",
          "cue_keywords": [
            "third",
