          "anchor_id": "cue_s07_c3_now_apply_exponential_moving_average",
          "text": "Now apply the exponential moving average, and those oscillations are dramatically damped, across architectures, dataset sizes, and multiple tasks, with no change to the learning rate schedule or batch size.",
