          "anchor_id": "cue_s08_c1_ablations_what_make_diagnosis_convin",
          "text": "The ablations are what make the diagnosis convincing. The oscillations refuse to go away as you vary dataset size, swap a multilayer perceptron for a Transformer, scale the model, or add regularizers.",
