          "chunk_id": "s10_c02",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s10_c2_stochastic_gradient_noise_completely",
          "text": "Stochastic gradient noise is completely harmless for the one-step training loss you watch, but once your model sits inside a feedback loop, that same noise gets amplified into chaotic, catastrophic failures over long horizons.",
