          "anchor_id": "cue_s10_c3_they_call_gradient_variance_amplific",
          "text": "They call this gradient variance amplification. The good news is that the fix is almost free. Keep an exponential moving average of your weights, and you get a cheap, broadly effective stabilizer.",
